cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "Transistor-Level Design and Validation of a Silicon-Carbide JFET Intel-4004-Compatible 4-bit Processor"
abstract: >-
  A transistor-level SiC JFET implementation of an Intel-4004-compatible
  4-bit microprocessor, captured at the schematic level in LTspice and
  validated by register-level co-simulation against a Python reference
  emulator plus measured-versus-simulated agreement of physical NAND
  and NOR primitive gates from 1 Hz to 1 MHz.
authors:
