  - family-names: Horsfall
    given-names: Alton
    affiliation: Durham University
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-2772-2006"
keywords:
  - silicon carbide
  - JFET
  - microprocessor
  - Intel 4004
  - extreme environment electronics
  - high temperature electronics
  - resistor-transistor logic
  - LTspice
  - emulator co-validation
